    "sections": {
        "description": "Take your taxi business online with the VW Taxi Booking Theme, designed for cab companies, ride-hailing services, car rental businesses, airport transfers, private taxi operators, and transportation service providers while supporting ecommerce functionality for selling travel passes, corporate ride packages, and online booking services through WooCommerce, making it ideal for modern digital taxi platforms and service-based online stores; this responsive, mobile-friendly theme features professional layouts for online taxi booking, fleet showcases, driver profiles, fare calculators, instant reservations, and secure payments, with Contact Form 7 for customer inquiries and Yoast SEO for search-optimized visibility, helping attract more clients searching for taxi booking, cab services, airport pickups, and city rides; with real-time availability updates, flexible ride scheduling, fast performance, intuitive navigation, and customizable pre-built pages, VW Taxi Booking Theme offers a conversion-focused, user-friendly platform that streamlines operations, boosts bookings, and establishes a strong online presence for ride-hailing startups, taxi companies, and digital transportation businesses. Demo:https://www.vwthemes.net/vw-taxi-booking-pro/"
    },
